 "title": "【消えた13億リットル】全てを飲み込んだ湖：ペニョール湖【ゆっくり解説】",
 "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/2fSskgljAnQ/maxresdefault.webp",
 "description": "1980年、アメリカ・ルイジアナ州で湖が突然消失する前代未聞の事故が発生。高さ45mの掘削リグが水深3mの湖に呑み込まれ、直径400mの巨大な渦が出現。地下では51人の鉱夫が命がけの脱出劇を繰り広げていた。\n\n参考情報\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yRhesBaRCME\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_feWtkSucvE\n\nThe Jefferson Island Mine inundation : report of mine inundation, Jefferson Island Mine, Diamond Crystal Salt Company, New Iberia, Iberia Parish, Louisiana, November 20, 1980\nhttps://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=uc1.31822029061140&seq=1\n\nThe Lake Peigneur Disaster: How a Misplaced Oil Rig Rewrote the Geography of Louisiana\nhttps://oddfeed.net/lake-peigneur/\n\nThe Lake Peigneur Drilling Disaster\nhttps://www.amusingplanet.com/2022/04/the-lake-peigneur-drilling-disaster.html\n\nCase Study: Lake Peigneur\nhttps://blog.thinkreliability.com/case-study-lake-peigneur\n\nLessons not Learned in LA: Lake Peigneur 1980 & Bayou Corne 2012\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/publication/292970207_Lessons_not_Learned_in_LA_Lake_Peigneur_1980_Bayou_Corne_2012\n\nEthics Case Study on Lake Peigneur Disappearance\nhttps://www.suncam.com/miva/downloads/docs/559.pdf\n\nLAKE PEIGNEUR TMDLS FOR\nDISSOLVED OXYGEN AND NUTRIENTS\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20150924143856/https%3A//www.epa.gov/waters/tmdldocs/FTNLakePeigneur.pdf\n\nLandscape evolution of the Five Islands of south Louisiana: scientific policy and salt dome utilization and management\nhttps://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0169555X02000867\n\nReport of Mine Inundation Jefferson Island Mine Diamond Crystal Salt Company  \nhttps://usminedisasters.miningquiz.com/saxsewell/1980_jefferson_island.pdf\n\nDrilling rig breaks into salt mine cavity, draining lake\nhttps://www.upi.com/Archives/1980/11/21/Drilling-rig-breaks-into-salt-mine-cavity-draining-lake/6665343630800/\n\nDIAMOND CRYSTAL-100 YEARS OF EXCELLENCE\nhttps://frankmoore.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/11/dslt5.pdf\n\nPIA18040: NASA Radar Demonstrates Ability to Foresee Sinkholes\nhttps://photojournal.jpl.nasa.gov/catalog/PIA18040\n\nAn Ominous Effervescence\nhttps://64parishes.org/an-ominous-effervescence\n\n【お知らせ】メンバーシップを開始しました。\nいつも応援ありがとうございます。\nメンバーシップで今後の活動をサポートしていただけると、大きな励みになります。\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWX0rU4o9CR8nUJKz0bSMlQ/join\n\n▼使用素材\n■映像素材・画像素材\npixabay\nhttps://pixabay.com/ja/videos/\npexels\nhttps://www.pexels.com/ja-jp/videos/\nACイラスト\nhttps://www.ac-illust.com/\nFreepik\nhttps://jp.freepik.com/\nSILHOUETTE DESIGN\nhttps://kage-design.com/\n\n■音源素材\nartlist\nhttps://artlist.io/\nhttps://pocketse.booth.pm/items/3767621\n効果音ラボ\nhttps://soundeffect-lab.info/\n\n【楽曲提供：株式会社ウナシ】\n\n#ゆっくり解説 #地理 #地政学",
